    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Interview is the transfer of energy. You must",
      "text": "Interview is the transfer of energy. You must have energy, excitement. Your top-paying skills are NOT your technical skills, but your enthusiasm. I have learned this lesson almost 20 years ago from Charly McAliley He was making $300/hour when I was making $115/hour. He has explained to me why he was paid much more . It was quite eye opening. Same idea is explained very well in this famous book: \" How I Raised Myself from Failure to Success in Selling \" by Frank Bettger .. https://www.amazon.com/Raised-Myself-Failure-Success-Selling/dp/067179437X Charly McAliley - https://www.legacy.com/us/obituaries/atlanta/name/charles-mcaliley-obituary?n=charles-mcaliley&pid=86229824 Interview is the transfer of energy During the face-to-face interview you can do the following: smile, be positive, feel good be attentive and supporting listener be a cheerleader for the other person be happy and relaxed radiate bubbling positive energy build trust, be authentic be excited and curious about the person, technology, project, company"
    }
